OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FElizabeth Alker with an afternoon
OL,7,     Fof great music-making -
OL,8,     Fmezzo-soprano Alice Coote and
OL,9,     Fpianist Sergey Rybin live from
OL,10,     FWigmore Hall, plus highlights from
OL,11,     Fthe Edinburgh Festival.
OL,12,G1600 Composer of the Week: Schubert
OL,13,     F1/5. Kate Molleson explores the
OL,14,     Flast five years of Franz
OL,15,     FSchubert's life, focusing today on
OL,16,     Fthe year 1824, when Schubert
OL,17,     Fcomposes his Rosamunde String
OL,18,     FQuartet.
OL,19,G1700 In Tune
OL,20,     FPetroc welcomes Salome Jordania
OL,21,     Fand Raphael Paratore from the
OL,22,     FGoldmund Quartet.
